(9181, 502, 'full_width_components_4_content', '&nbsp;\r\n<h4>View360 Global™ promotes these principles in the delivery process</h4>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-500 size-large\" src=\"https://cognitas.msonet.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Screenshot-2020-05-29-at-11.37.18-1024x382.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"382\" />\r\n\r\nView360 Global™ has been used by clients and practitioners in many countries throughout Europe, Asia and the Caribbean\r\n<blockquote>“Knowledge results from the combination of grasping experience and transforming it.”\r\n\r\n- <i>Professor D.A Kolb - Kolb’s theory of experiential learning</i></blockquote>\r\nFind out more about immersive training and how <b>View360 Global™</b> can help you transform your business'),
