(13549, 580, 'full_width_components_2_two_column_content_0_text', 'Collaborating closely with EXPOL and their established clients, we co designed and delivered a series of independent and well attended blended learning training events, where the immersive scenarios and media content were specifically designed to meet the operational needs of the diverse beneficiary organisations'),
