(15596, 608, 'full_width_components_0_timeline_items_0_timeline_content', 'User Friendly The View360 Global™ platform is easy-to-use and requires no complex IT infrastructure, just a PC, laptop or tablet. Meanwhile, our simple ‘point, click and type’ functionality keeps the emphasis on learning rather than navigating complicated operational features.  <br><br> In a single one-to-one training session, our experts will give your facilitators the skills they need to use the platform confidently. We also provide additional support with online tutorials. '),
