(21197, 678, 'full_width_components_5_content', 'It’s a practitioner approach to creating and demonstrating the organisational value of training – and shows clearly the degree to which expectations have been satisfied.\r\n\r\n<b>We use the established New World Kirkpatrick model to measure your ROE.</b>\r\n\r\nThis is one of a number of proven methodologies that we employ for the measurement of data as part of our <a href=\"https://cognitas.msonet.co.uk/consultancy-services/\"><u>consultancy services</u>.</a>\r\n\r\nAs certified Kirkpatrick model practitioners we can provide:\r\n<div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center;\">\r\n<ul style=\"align-items: flex-start;\">\r\n 	<li>A full analysis of the training you’ve delivered</li>\r\n 	<li>Evidence of achieving outcomes and objectives</li>\r\n 	<li>Recommendations for continued professional development.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-516 size-large\" src=\"https://cognitas.msonet.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/Screenshot-2020-05-29-at-12.02.35-e1590750284396-1024x532.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"532\" />'),
