(7122, 456, 'full_width_components_8_testimonials_1_text', 'View360 Global™ was the ideal platform to provide Critical incident training that was tailored to my organisation. All of our communication was Cognitas Global Ltd was fantastic - their team took time to understand our organisation and made suggestions on our requirements. View360 Global™ was the ideal platform to provide Critical incident training that was tailored to my organisation.\r\n '),
