(12482, 432, 'full_width_components_4_two_column_content_0_text', 'When you purchase one of our service plans, we’ll provide you with website access to your own account management page. From there, you can manage your account.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Provide administrator information</li>\r\n 	<li>Register facilitator details</li>\r\n 	<li>Manage passwords</li>\r\n 	<li>Monitor session usage</li>\r\n 	<li>Access online tutorials</li>\r\n 	<li>FAQs</li>\r\n</ul>'),
