(16466, 631, 'full_width_components_0_team_members_1_content', 'Colin is currently Head of Co-investments at Aberdeen Standard Private Equity. Colin is responsible for all aspects of ASI co-investments including sourcing, appraising and executing investments. He also sits on the ASI PE Management Committee as well as the European Investment Committee. Colin has been with Aberdeen Standard Investments and its predecessor companies since 2006. Prior to this he spent 6 years at Bridgepoint investing in mid-market European private equity. He began his career advising on mid-market buyouts with Andersen Corporate Finance. Colin holds an LLB (Hons) in Law from the University of Strathclyde and a Securities Institute Diploma.'),
