(17603, 640, '_full_width_components_1_title', 'field_5eaaa9e6b2cfb_field_5eaaa8a084c50'),
(17604, 640, 'full_width_components_1_subtitle', '<strong>If you need to test and develop decision making skills, our versatile View360 Global™ platform allows you to create an immersive online learning environment tailored to meet your specific needs.  <br><br> Here are just some of the areas where our clients have discovered its advantages:</strong>'),
