(17712, 640, 'full_width_components_6_alternating_image_text_0_text', 'At Cognitas, every member of our highly qualified and motivated team is a specialist in their field. Together, we bring extensive learning and development experience, complimented by many years of operational expertise. This enables us to deliver technical support and training within all areas of the public and private sectors '),
(17713, 640, '_full_width_components_6_alternating_image_text_0_text', 'field_5eac064a5f1f2'),
