(18428, 643, 'full_width_components_8_testimonials_0_text', 'View360 Global™ was the ideal platform to provide Critical incident training that was tailored to my organisation. All of our communication was Cognitas Global Ltd was fantastic - their team took time to understand our organisation and made suggestions on our requirements.'),
(18429, 643, '_full_width_components_8_testimonials_0_text', 'field_5cac5d7b5b816'),
