(22865, 690, 'full_width_components_7_content', 'Cognitas Global is currently working with a small number of UK-based educational and charitable organisations who need assistance with their Learning and Development programmes and may not be able to finance that themselves.\r\n\r\nWe are now taking applications for 2021.'),
