(26573, 746, 'full_width_components_0_content', '<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Simply delivering the learning is not enough. The measurement and analysis of recorded data is critical for laying the foundations of sustainable organisational growth.</h1>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Multilingual Data Capture</h2>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Real-time monitoring enables the facilitator to review participants’ progress during the learning experience – and afterwards, the record of activity provides clear evidence that desired outcomes have been met</p>'),
