(27930, 787, 'full_width_components_1_subtitle', 'If you need to test and develop decision making skills, our versatile View360 Global™ platform allows you to create an immersive online learning environment tailored to meet your specific needs.  <br><br> Here are just some of the areas where our clients have discovered its advantages:'),
