(30092, 808, 'full_width_components_3_testimonials_0_text', 'Whether you opt for our licencing plan or choose to work with us on a consultancy basis, we provide comprehensive support.\r\n<br><br>\r\nAll our clients receive dedicated training on the technical use of the platform, as well as course design and delivery methodologies at no extra cost.\r\n<br>'),
